AZRTOS_APP_MEM_ALLOCATION_METHOD_STANDALONE|Memory Allocation|Memory Configuration||||<b> Use Static Allocation </b> : use predefined threadX memory pools for allocation. a static <b>TX_BYTE_POOL </b> is created using the <code> tx_byte_pool_create() </code> API and allocations are done with <code>tx_byte_allocate() </code> <b> Use Dynamic Allocation </b> :Using dynamic memory allocation requires to apply some changes to the linker file. + <b><i>ThreadX</i></b> ThreadX needs to pass a pointer to the first free memory location in RAM to the <code>tx_application_define()</code> function, <i>"first_unused_memory"</i> argument.This require changes in the linker files to expose this memory location. <ul> <li>For EWARM <i>add the following section into the .icf</i> file</li> <code> place in RAM_region { last section FREE_MEM}; </code> <li>For STM32CubeIDE <i>add the following section into the .ld </i>file</li> define the symbol <b>__RAM_segment_used_end__</b> <code> ._threadx_heap : { . = ALIGN(8); ` __RAM_segment_used_end__= .; . = .+64K; ` } >RAM_D1 AT> RAM_D1 </code> </ul> the<code> "tx_initialize_low_level.s" </code> The "tx_initialize_low_level.S" should be also modified to enable the "USE_DYNAMIC_MEMORY_ALLOCATION" flag.
UX_HOST_APP_MEM_POOL_SIZE_STANDALONE|UXHost memory pool size|Memory Configuration||512|262144|Default memory pool size for the USBXHost application.<font color="red">The allocated memory for all enabled middelwares should not exceed the total size of available memory.</font>
UX_DEVICE_APP_MEM_POOL_SIZE_STANDALONE|UXDevice memory pool size|Memory Configuration||512|262144|Default memory pool size for the USBXDevice application.<font color="red">The allocated memory for all enabled middelwares should not exceed the total size of available memory.</font>
UX_HOST_APP_MEM_POOL_SIZE|UXHost memory pool size|Memory Configuration||512|262144|Default memory pool size for the USBXHost application.<font color="red">The allocated memory for all enabled middelwares should not exceed the total size of available memory.</font>
UX_DEVICE_APP_MEM_POOL_SIZE|UXDevice memory pool size|Memory Configuration||512|262144|Default memory pool size for the USBXDevice application.<font color="red">The allocated memory for all enabled middelwares should not exceed the total size of available memory.</font>
