USBX_DEVICE_SYS_SIZE|USBX Device System Stack Size|USBX Device Common Init||512|=262144|default Size of the regular memory pool for USBX stack must be less than the memory pool size. Required value: - HID class : 4*1024 - Storage class : 5*1024 - DFU class: 4*1024 - CDC ACM class: 6*1024 - CDC ECM class: 34*1024 - VIDEO class: 6*1024 - RNDIS class: 34*1024 - MTP class: 12*1024 - Printer Class:3*1024 - CCID Class:8*1024 - Composite : addition of class required memory.
REG_USBX_DEVICE_CON_CK|USBX Device Register Connection Callback|USBX Device Common Init||||Register USBX Device Connection Callback invoked when: - USB Device Connected. - USB Device Disconnected. - USB SOF Received. - USB Device Suspended. - USB Device Resumed. - USB Device Removed. - USB Device Attached.
