UVC_BITS_PER_PIXEL|UVC_BITS_PER_PIXEL|Device Class VIDEO||0|255|Number of bits per pixel used to specify color in the decoded video frame.
UVC_COLOR_PRIMARIE|UVC_COLOR_PRIMARIE|Device Class VIDEO||0|255|This defines the color primaries and the reference white. 0: Unspecified (Image characteristics unknown) 1: BT.709, sRGB (default) 2: BT.470-2 (M) 3: BT.470-2 (B, G) 4: SMPTE 170M 5: SMPTE 240M 6-255: Reserved
UVC_TFR_CHARACTERISTICS|UVC_TFR_CHARACTERISTICS|Device Class VIDEO||0|255|This field defines the optoelectronic transfer characteristic of the source picture also called the gamma function. 0: Unspecified (Image characteristics unknown) 1: BT.709 (default) 2: BT.470-2 M 3: BT.470-2 B, G 4: SMPTE 170M 5: SMPTE 240M 6: Linear (V = Lc) 7: sRGB (very similar to BT.709) 8-255: Reserved
UVC_MATRIX_COEFFICIENTS|UVC_MATRIX_COEFFICIENTS|Device Class VIDEO||0|255|Matrix used to compute luma and chroma values from the color primaries. 0: Unspecified (Image characteristics unknown) 1: BT. 709 2: FCC 3: BT.470-2 B, G 4: SMPTE 170M (BT.601, default) 5: SMPTE 240M 6-255: Reserved
